title: Firedamp
subtitle: An explosion underground.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('mine_disaster'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('mine_disaster');
if (!Q.lw_pit) { Q.lw_pit = 'a pit at ' + Q.lw_town; }
Q.lw_dead = RG.lw.rnd(18, 84);
Q.lw_pit_town = Q.lw_pit.replace(/^.* at /, '').replace(/^.* near /, '');
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {militancy: 6});
RG.news(Q.lw_dead + ' miners killed in explosion at ' + Q.lw_pit_town, 3);
RG.ledger(Q.lw_dead + ' miners died in an explosion at ' + Q.lw_pit + '.', 'lw_mine_' + (Q.lw_fired.mine_disaster || 1));
!}

= Firedamp

At the change of shift, firedamp exploded in the deepest seam of **[+ lw_pit +]**, in [+ lw_d_name +]. The rescue teams brought up [+ lw_dead +] bodies, and a pit pony that had somehow lived. The miners say the ventilation was cut back in the spring to save money. The funerals are on Saturday, and the whole district will be watching who speaks.

- @strike: Call the coalfield out from the graveside.
- @relief: Pay for the coffins and feed the families.

@strike
subtitle: Every pit in the district stops until the owners answer for the dead.
on-arrival: {!
RG.startStrike(Q.lw_d);
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 5, members: 0.04});
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

The next morning the winding gear is still across the district.

@relief
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The district will remember who was there.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {loyalty: 12, members: 0.06});
!}

The party pays for the coffins nobody else would pay for, and the women's group runs the kitchen in the pit village for a month. At the funeral the red flag is on every third coffin.
